### 注册
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "account": "test001",
  "password": "123456",
  "nickname": "测试用户"
}

### 登录
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "account": "test001",
  "password": "123456"
}

### 获取词书列表
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books

### 获取某本词书的单词
GET http://localhost:8080/api/words?bookId=1

### 获取学习记录
GET http://localhost:8080/api/study-records?userId=1

### 获取生词本
GET http://localhost:8080/api/notebook-words?userId=1

### 获取错题本
GET http://localhost:8080/api/wrong-words?userId=1

### 获取个人资料
GET http://localhost:8080/api/user/profile?userId=1

### 修改个人资料
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/user/profile
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 1,
  "nickname": "Morning Reader",
  "dailyTarget": 40,
  "signature": "Keep learning every day",
  "selectedBookId": 2
}

### 提交答题结果：答错
POST http://localhost:8080/api/study/submit
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 1,
  "bookTitle": "四级高频词汇",
  "wordId": 1,
  "word": "aband",
  "meaning": "放弃；抛弃",
  "isCorrect": false,
  "selectedAnswer": "出现；显现",
  "correctAnswer": "放弃；抛弃",
  "sentence": "Do not abandon your daily plan.",
  "reason": "选择了相近但错误的释义"
}

### 提交答题结果：答对
POST http://localhost:8080/api/study/submit
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 1,
  "bookTitle": "四级高频词汇",
  "wordId": 2,
  "word": "benefit",
  "meaning": "益处；有益于",
  "isCorrect": true,
  "selectedAnswer": "益处；有益于",
  "correctAnswer": "益处；有益于",
  "sentence": "Reading aloud can benefit your memory.",
  "reason": ""
}

### 加入生词本
POST http://localhost:8080/api/notebook-words
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 1,
  "wordId": 1,
  "word": "abandon",
  "meaning": "放弃；抛弃",
  "bookTitle": "四级高频词汇",
  "masteryLabel": "待复习",
  "nextReview": "2026-04-23",
  "noteText": "常见搭配 abandon a plan。"
}

### 删除生词本记录
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/notebook-words/3?userId=1

### 删除错题本记录
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/wrong-words/2?userId=1

### 获取首页统计
GET http://localhost:8080/api/stats/overview?userId=1

### 获取词书学习进度
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books/progress?userId=1

### 获取下一道练习单词
GET http://localhost:8080/api/words/next?bookId=1

### 外部 API 查词
GET http://localhost:8080/api/words/search?keyword=hello

###
GET http://localhost:8080/api/words/search?keyword=apple

### 获取词书学习进度
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books/progress?userId=1

